  "result": "The O4 quiz is ready: `quizzes/0002.json`, with its key at `keys/0002.json`. It has six items on telling workflows from agents by who owns the control flow, and on when a fixed workflow is the better choice.\n\n- **Format:** Three items are multiple choice, two are short answers of a word or two, and one is a calculation. All are set in the makerspace assistant, so the booking, manual-search and routing cases come from your project.\n- **Ahead of the lessons:** There is no lesson on O4 yet, so the quiz checks the objective itself. I wrote it from what I know of the standard workflow-versus-agent distinction and did not search for or read a source. A lesson on O4 would be a good next step if you want one.\n- **Misconception ids:** I gave the new misconceptions ids M7 to M10, as no earlier file defines them. I couldn't tell whether M2 and M5 are already in use, so I started at M7. You may want to check that M7 to M10 don't clash with anything.\n- **Bookkeeping:** I didn't update `NOTES.md`. Quiz 0001 is still ungraded, with two submissions waiting.",
